                     │
          ┌──────────┼──────────┐
          │          │          │
        INSERT     UPDATE     DELETE
          │          │          │
          ↓          ↓          ↓
         ADD       CHANGE     REMOVE
          │          │          │
          └──────────┼──────────┘
                     ↓
                   DATA
                     ↓
                  TABLE
```

And:

```text
DDL
 ↓
Create the table

DML
 ↓
Put data into the table

DML
 ↓
Change the data

DML
 ↓
Remove the data
```

